              "content": "=Context:\n- firstName: {{ $json.from }}\n- originalBody: {{ $json.textPlain }}\n\nTask:\nWrite an email to {{ $json.From }}\n\nRules:\n1) First sentence: reflect their interest from originalBody (no added facts; 8–16 words).\n2) Core: suggest a short intro call to explore fit; ask for good time options for meeting and the literal calendar link: https://calendly.com/your-name/30min) Offer to share a brief capabilities overview if helpful (no links/attachments).\n4) Keep it warm and low-pressure.\n\nDOn't add a subject line, give me the body of the email only, starting from Hi to end with this signature\n\nAlex Morgan\nAcme Supply\np: 555 010 0000\nw: www.example.com \ne: sales@example.com\n"
            }
